>>
Rule 1 (returned RNG state is a 1D ByteTensor)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 1 ∧ dtype_(v_1) = 5
>>
Rule 2 (state tensor length is positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) > 0
>>
Rule 3 (all dimensions of the state tensor have positive size)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 4 (byte-range values for RNG state)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 5 then min(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ max(v_1) ≤ 255
